l print (write each line in order).\\"}],\\"finalCheck\\":\\"State the printed output you get and note any difference from your earlier prediction. If your answer differed, identify which step (index values, element access, or order) caused the mismatch.\\",\\"sourceGrounding\\":[{\\"label\\":\\"Python for statement (official docs)\\",\\"reference\\":\\"https://docs.python.org/3/reference/compound_stmts.html#the-for-statement\\"}]}", "startedAtMs": 68387, "completedAtMs": 68387, "sourceAnchors": [], "decisionFactors": ["Topic profile recommends 'worked_example' after a prediction for practice.", "Student Persona shows repeated struggle — concrete stepwise modelling is helpful.", "Remaining time is limited, so a single concise worked example is appropriate to consolidate understanding.", "The prior prediction surfaced a model that should be checked by applying an example."], "artifactProposed": false, "expectedEvidence": "Student completes the worked example (fills or explains 3–4 intermediate steps) and correctly states the loop's printed output or identifies where their earlier prediction differed.", "firstContentAtMs": 68387, "studentSafeReason": "A short, guided worked example immediately after the prediction reveals correct application of iteration and supports remediation for off-by-one or ordering mistakes without overloading the student.", "studentConsentRequired": false}], "runId": "petros-stage5-live-smoke-v1", "usage": [{"source": "evaluation", "retries": 0, "cacheHit": false, "modelKey": "gpt-5-mini-2025-08-07", "fallbacks": 0, "latencyMs": 11637, "requestId": "d1300429-1226-4fbe-8552-294911c35aed", "costMicros": 2914, "functionKey": "teaching.next_action.select", "inputTokens": 21816, "providerKey": "openai-live-eval", "outputTokens": 1005, "validationFailures": 0}, {"source": "evaluation", "retries": 0, "cacheHit": false, "modelKey": "gpt-5-mini-2025-08-07", "fallbacks": 0, "latencyMs": 4898, "requestId": "22ca8477-2d6d-441c-b4b1-10843867f7fd", "costMic